Project Name- FedEx Logistics Performance

Business Questions
Which countries receive the highest number of shipments?
Which shipment mode is used most frequently?
Which vendors handle the highest shipment volume?
Which countries generate the highest shipment value?
What are the top-performing products and brands?
How does freight cost vary across shipments?
What is the relationship between shipment weight and freight cost?
Which manufacturing sites contribute the most shipments?
What are the key trends and patterns in logistics operations?
What insights can help improve logistics efficiency and reduce costs


Key Insights
Air shipment mode contributes the highest shipment volume and freight cost.
A small number of vendors handle a large percentage of shipments.
Certain countries dominate shipment demand and revenue generation.
Freight cost generally increases with shipment weight.
A few products and brands contribute significantly to total shipment quantity.
Shipment trends vary across months and years, indicating seasonal demand patterns.
Manufacturing sites contribute unevenly to shipment distribution.
Data-driven optimization can significantly reduce logistics costs and improve operational efficiency.
